  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="67">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 67</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="67" corresp="#wit-d"><pb n="384" ed="#liebermann"/>Ealle we sculon ænne God lufian ⁊ wurðian ⁊ ænne Cristendo<hi rend="italic">m</hi> georne healdan ⁊ ælcne hæðendo<hi rend="italic">m</hi> mid ealle awurpan.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-d"><pb n="314" ed="#rabin-doml"/>Ealle we sculon ænne God lufian and wurðian and ænne Cristendom georne healdan and ælcne hæðendom mid ealle awurpan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann"><pb n="384" ed="#liebermann"/>Alle sollen wir Einen Gott lieben und ehren und Ein Christenthum eifrig halten und jedes Heidenthum gänzlich verwerfen.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">We must all love and honour one God and eagerly hold one Christianity and utterly cast off every heathenism.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#whitelock" corresp="#wit-d"><ptr type="editorNote" n="1" target="#Northu_67.whinote.n.1"/><pb n="484" ed="#whitelock"/>We must all love and honour one God and zealously hold one Christian faith and entirely cast out every heathen practice.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-d"><pb n="315" ed="#rabin-doml"/>We must all love and revere one God and fervently adhere to one Christian faith and wholly reject every heathen practice.</ab>
        <note type="comparison" source="#liebermann" n="384"><ref target="clause:Northu_47">Northu 47</ref></note>
        <note type="comparisonPrinted" source="#liebermann">ebd. 47</note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#liebermann"><ref target="clause:Northu_47">Northu 47</ref>; <ref target="clause:Northu_67-1">Northu 67.1</ref></note>
        <note type="editorial">A repetition of 47.</note>
        <note type="editorNote" subtype="translationFootnote" xml:id="Northu_67.whinote.n.1" n="1" source="#whitelock"><bibl><biblScope unit="page">484</biblScope></bibl><label>67</label><seg type="original" xml:lang="en">cf. chap. 47</seg></note>
      </div>
    </body>
